<title>USA: Newpark Resources Inc Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Newpark Resources Inc Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>METAIRIE, La. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			  3,782		    2,700</p>
<p> Revs			28,551		   24,793</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,366		   10,301</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.92		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net			 10,982		    8,396</p>
<p> Revs			81,497		   69,456</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,946		   10,243</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 includes non-recurring, after-tax charge of $0.12 per share related to the acquisition of certain assets of a subsidiary of Sanifill Inc as well as the restructuring of its waste disposal operations.</p>
<p>Q3 1995 includes non-recurring acquisition costs of $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
